{
  "note": "Agencies that publish their own flight log to an ArcGIS feature service they run themselves, with no vendor involved. Found during the source census by searching ArcGIS Hub. The field mapping is an allow-list: several of these services expose pilot names, pilot email addresses, employee numbers and takeoff coordinates, and nothing reaches a record unless it is named here.",
  "sites": [
    {
      "agency_id": "bloomington-pd-il",
      "display_name": "Bloomington Police Department",
      "state": "IL",
      "timezone": "America/Chicago",
